{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22408","headline":"仙娥峰下作 · 白居易","name":"仙娥峰下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我爲东南行，始登商山道。\n商山无数峰，最爱仙娥好。\n参差树若插，匼匝云如抱。\n渴望寒玉泉，香闻紫芝草。\n青崖屏削碧，白石牀铺缟。\n向无如此物，安足留四皓。\n感彼私自问，归山何不早？\n可能尘土中，还随衆人老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}